## What it does

A telehealth platform where employees book and meet mental-health practitioners
over live chat, voice and video.

## Approach

End-to-end product work across scheduling, real-time communication, and the
interfaces around them, built to stay reliable for sensitive sessions.

## Stack

Python and Django REST on the backend, React and Next.js on the frontend, deployed
on AWS.
